sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant System
    participant ProcessModel
    participant AbstractSensor
    participant AbstractCalculation
    participant ControlElement
    participant PointRegistry

    Note over System, PointRegistry: Initialization Phase (add_component)
    
    User->>System: add_component(Sensor)
    activate System
    System->>PointRegistry: add(Sensor.measurement_point)
    System->>AbstractSensor: initialize(System)
    deactivate System

    User->>System: add_component(Calculation)
    activate System
    System->>AbstractCalculation: initialize(System)
    System->>PointRegistry: add(Calculation.output_point)
    deactivate System

    User->>System: add_component(ControlElement)
    activate System
    System->>ControlElement: initialize(System)
    System->>PointRegistry: add(ControlElement.controller_reference_point_dict)
    deactivate System
